# Bumbleflower's Sharepot ({2} Artifact): "When this artifact enters, create a Food token" (CR 111.10b) and "{5}, {T}, Sacrifice this
# artifact: Destroy target nonland permanent. Activate only as a sorcery" (CR 602.5d, 701.8). Turn 1: the Lotus pays {2}, the Food
# trigger is on the stack, so five untapped Moxen still cannot activate it (not a sorcery's timing); once the Food exists the
